  "result": "Perfect! All 44 tests pass. Here's what I've added:\n\n**src/errors.js** \u2014 Two new error codes:\n- `NOT_DRAFT`: Only draft invoices can be modified\n- `LINE_NOT_FOUND`: No line with that SKU on the invoice\n\n**src/invoices.js** \u2014 Two new functions:\n\n**`addLine(invoice, { sku, qty })`** \u2014 Adds or increments a line:\n- Returns `ok(newInvoice)` with the line added at the end (if new SKU) or qty increased (if SKU exists)\n- Validates `qty` like `createInvoice` (QTY_INVALID)\n- Validates SKU exists (UNKNOWN_SKU)\n- Refuses to modify non-draft invoices (NOT_DRAFT)\n- Never mutates the input\n\n**`removeLine(invoice, sku)`** \u2014 Removes a line by SKU:\n- Returns `ok(newInvoice)` without that SKU's line\n- Returns `LINE_NOT_FOUND` if SKU isn't on the invoice\n- Returns `NO_LINES` if it would remove the last line\n- Refuses to modify non-draft invoices (NOT_DRAFT)\n- Never mutates the input\n\n**test/invoices.test.js** \u2014 Added 12 comprehensive tests covering:\n- Adding new lines and incrementing existing ones\n- Copying catalogue details\n- Validation and error cases\n- Mutation safety for both functions\n\nAll 44 tests pass \u2713",
